<title>FINLAND: MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES LOWER AT FIX.</title>
<headline>MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES LOWER AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Most Helibor market interest</p>
<p>rates were lower at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on</p>
<p>Wednesday. The key three-month rate was steady at 3.40 percent.</p>
<p>				    August 28 fix	 August 27 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor		     3.26 pct	     3.27 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor		     3.34 pct	     3.34 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor		     3.40 pct	     3.40 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor		     3.55 pct	     3.56 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor		     3.71 pct	     3.73 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor		    3.86 pct	     3.89 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 248</p>
</text>
